# Unit vectors of many lines and stack values, read back with GPV. The
# reference's normalization is not an exact rounding of the unit vector; the
# candidate's reproduces most but not all of these (an open difference).
# Each glyph's program computes values and writes value i into the y of
# point i of a 32-point contour (SCFS along y), so the dump shows them.
heights 16384 1000
fpgm
  PUSH 0; FDEF; ENDF
end
